REMARK 250 RNA hairpin GGGCGCAAGCCU, 12 nucleotides, GCAA tetraloop.
REMARK 250 Provenance: model 1 of PDB 1ZIH, a SOLUTION NMR structure (never a
REMARK 250 crystal), standard residues only, hydrogens rebuilt from the OL3
REMARK 250 templates, energy minimised, then 50 ps of Langevin dynamics at
REMARK 250 300 K with GBn2 implicit solvent.
REMARK 250 Its 12 sugars enter 100% C3'-endo (North, P = 12.9 deg), the A-form
REMARK 250 signature -- which is what makes it a pucker test and not just a
REMARK 250 second nucleic structure.
